// Pull request author: saakovv
// Change: new rule
// Title: Linux Privilege Escalation via Niche GTFOBins Binaries
// Sigma ID: b8e3f6d1-1c7a-4f29-b2d8-9a4e7c3f6b10
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Ivan Saakov
// Date: 2026-05-10 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, T1548.003
// Description: Detects privilege escalation attempts via niche GTFOBins-listed binaries invoked with sudo.
//   These binaries are not commonly used for privilege escalation and may evade detection rules
//   focused on well-known bins like python or perl. Covered binaries include csvtool, emacs, gem,
//   mysql, composer, cpulimit, and debugfs, each of which can spawn a privileged shell when executed
//   with sudo and specific flags.
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate administrative use of these binaries with sudo in approved workflows
//   - Authorized red team exercise or offensive security testing
// References:
//   - https://gtfobins.github.io/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/e5bac28da3655c33390db7ef1503db8cd3babb5f/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_gtfobins_niche_privesc.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains "csvtool" and ProcessCommandLine contains "call" and ProcessCommandLine contains "sudo") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "emacs" and ProcessCommandLine contains "--eval" and ProcessCommandLine contains "sudo") or (FolderPath endswith "/gem" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "open -e" or ProcessCommandLine contains "-c sudo")) or (FolderPath endswith "/mysql" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "-e" and ProcessCommandLine contains "sudo" and ProcessCommandLine contains "\\!")) or (ProcessCommandLine contains "composer" and ProcessCommandLine contains "run-script" and ProcessCommandLine contains "sudo") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "sudo" and ProcessCommandLine contains "cpulimit" and ProcessCommandLine contains "-l" and ProcessCommandLine contains "-f") or (FolderPath endswith "/debugfs" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "!/bin/sh" or ProcessCommandLine contains "!/bin/bash"))
